      "start": 7.577,
      "end": 11.2
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The intercom crackled, whispering my blood type before going dead silent.",
      "search_term": "old intercom speaker",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Old hospital intercom speaker crackling with static, the sound fading to silence.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.443,
      "start": 11.58,
      "end": 15.023
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I followed the gurney to Room\u202f207, its door yawning wide.",
      "search_term": "hospital room door open",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Hospital room door numbered 207 swinging open wide, revealing a dark interior.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.303,
      "start": 15.443,
      "end": 18.746
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Inside, a sheet-covered figure turned, revealing a face as pale as plaster.",
      "search_term": "hospital patient sheet reveal",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A patient on a gurney pulls back a white sheet, exposing a ghostly pale face.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.645,
      "start": 19.207,
      "end": 23.852
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Its eyes were my own, hollow and pleading, while a vent voice hissed, 'You never left.'",
      "search_term": "hollow eyes closeup",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "Close\u2011up of hollow, pleading eyes reflecting a dim light.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 5.025,
      "start": 24.272,
      "end": 29.297
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The floor gave way, dropping me into a hidden chute that led to a bright, crowded ward.",
      "search_term": "hospital stairs descending",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A sudden floor opening reveals a dark chute that descends into a brightly lit, busy hospital ward.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.mp4",
